{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"better\": \"X\",\n  \"regress\": \"有，X在S01、S03、S06等段落的感受词仍然偏密，部分近义描述连续出现，容易让观众来不及消化；但分时出现和大小层级在一定程度上缓解了这个问题。\",\n  \"nets\": {\n    \"scan\": \"X\",\n    \"point\": \"X\",\n    \"why\": \"X\",\n    \"whole\": \"X\",\n    \"fine\": \"X\"\n  },\n  \"why\": \"X的重点话语有明确的视觉突出，短句分段也让观众更容易抓住人物每一阶段的心理变化；感受词又通过分时出现与音乐进程对应，不必一次面对所有信息。更重要的是，X把人物为什么舍不得、为什么不敢回去、为什么逐渐接受带着想念继续生活交代得更具体，音乐感受也从局部音色、节奏、动作延伸到情绪转折，前后形成了更细密的呼应。Y的叙述比较顺畅，但部分心理动机和音乐细节被概括掉了，尤其难以充分呈现人物既怀念亲近又不愿重新忍受委屈的复杂心情。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "b7e2da72-23ed-4827-a51d-07e29a777d98", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261108T022512054715Z", "elapsed_seconds": 54.5, "completed_utc": "2026-11-08T02:26:06.573797+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "64ed5131c02fd3add70d8eade9b802f95b5f820ad74d76cdf5a828b71eaba21d", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995